"""Evidence: what outside sources say about companies and the market, kept with where each item came from.

Every item has a source (with a trust tier and a health line), a link, a published time and the time we first saw it. Items are stored point in time and never rewritten, so a later study can ask what was
known on a given day. Nothing here feeds a verdict: whether any of it predicts returns has not been tested (see docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-29-evidence-and-sentiment-sources-plan.md)."""
